# Build and repository structure

When editing compile scripts or build flow:

1. Keep `compile-apresentacoes.sh` aligned with `apresentacoes/main.tex` output expectations.
2. Keep generated metrics integration intact (`content/assets/generated/benchmark_macros.tex`).
3. Ensure build instructions reflect tracked repository files rather than local-only scripts.
4. Do not assume monograph-specific commands or legacy controller files.
